    "https://juniata.peopleadmin.com/postings/1828": {
      "title": "Juniata College Applicant Portal",
      "description": "Juniata College Applicant Portal | Custodian Skip to Main Content Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Custodian Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening.  To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark link. To email this position to a friend, click on the Email to a Friend link.  If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. All applicants must complete our online application form. No phone calls or walk-ins please. Posting Details Position Information Job Title Custodian Posting Number 20110673 Pay Rate $17.84/hour Position Type Facilities Services Position Summary Information Key Responsibilities Juniata College invites applicants for one open Custodian position. Under general supervision, performs necessary duties to keep assigned buildings and/or areas in clean, neat and orderly condition. Performs various other activities as assigned. Clears snow and ice from, but not limited to, stairs, walks, driveways and College roads either manually or using motorized equipment. Performs necessary repairs and routine and planned maintenance on custodial equipment. Juniata College is committed to cultivating an equity-minded and equity-engaged campus culture, one that is inclusive and supportive of its students, faculty, and staff. We believe that all members of the College community share the responsibility to value diversity, seek equity, promote a sense of belonging. We seek candidates who are sensitive to the needs of an academic community that is diverse with regard to gender, race, ethnicity, religion, nationality, sexual orientation or identity, disability status, and protected veteran status … EOE Position Qualifications -Experience in custodial or related field -High school graduate or GED , as well as the ability to read, write and perform basic math -Ability to operate all College owned vehicles and custodial equipment -Valid PA driver’s license, clear of major violations. It is the policy of Juniata College to conduct background checks. Supervision Required/Given Oral and/or written instructions received from designated supervisor. Employees in this classification have no supervisory duties. Preferred Qualifications See position qualifications Physical Demands -Ability to push, pull and lift 40lbs regularly -Ability to work on ladders at heights of 10’ Special Instructions to Applicants All applicants must complete our online application form. No phone calls or walk-ins please. Posting Detail Information Open Date 07/13/2026 Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Applicant Documents Required Documents Optional Documents Resume Cover Letter List of 3 References Juniata College 1700 Moore Street Huntingdon, PA 16652 Phone: (877) 586-4282 Fax: (814) 641-3199 Email: info@juniata.edu To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
